    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "2 1. A group of Writ Petitions is listed before this Court at Sr. No.4 in the cause list today.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2592,
      "end": 2688,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "2. After hearing Learned Counsel for the parties we find that although distinct issues arise in these Petitions, all of them have been clubbed together.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2689,
      "end": 2842,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "Purti Parab 4-WP-1166-2018 @ ORS.DOC",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2843,
      "end": 2880,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Purti Parab",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 2844,
          "end": 2855
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "3. In fact, the Learned Counsel for the Petitioner in Writ Petition No. 5639 of 2018 submits that the Petition is concerned with the Maharashtra Industrial Development Act, 1961 and the issue arising therein is completely distinct from the other Petitions listed in the group.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2881,
      "end": 3157,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Writ Petition No. 5639 of 2018",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2935,
          "end": 2965
        },
        {
          "text": "Maharashtra Industrial Development Act, 1961",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3014,
          "end": 3058
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26444581151008606
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "We are convinced that this Petition can be detagged to be heard independently.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3158,
      "end": 3236,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "4. We also find that the issue arising in Writ Petition No. 4915 of 2016, is also a distinct issue and it need not be clubbed alongwith the other Petitions in this group.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3238,
      "end": 3408,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Writ Petition No. 4915 of 2016",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3280,
          "end": 3310
        }
      ],
